sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant C as Customer
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant ES as Escrow Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant M as Merchant
    participant PO as Payout Service
    participant INT as Interswitch

    Note over C,INT: ── HAPPY PATH: Escrow Lifecycle ──

    %% Step 1: Create Escrow
    C->>AG: POST /escrow (X-Idempotency-Key)
    AG->>ES: Route request (JWT validated)
    ES->>ES: Validate merchant exists & verified (KYC docs in Cloudinary)
    ES->>ES: Look up fee from DB (fee_configurations)
    ES->>ES: Calculate fee, generate reference TXN-YYYY-XXXXXX
    ES->>INT: Create payment link
    INT-->>ES: Payment link URL
    ES->>ES: Save escrow (status=INITIATED)
    ES-->>AG: 201 { reference, paymentLink, fee breakdown }
    AG-->>C: 201 Created

    %% Step 2: Customer Pays
    C->>INT: Opens payment link, completes payment
    INT->>PS: POST /webhooks/interswitch/payments (webhook + HMAC signature)
    PS->>PS: Verify HMAC-SHA512 signature
    PS->>ES: Update escrow status → FUNDED
    ES->>ES: Record state history
    ES->>MQ: Publish escrow.funded
    ES->>MQ: Publish audit.event (diff via DiffAuditHelper)

    %% Step 3: Notify Merchant
    MQ->>NS: escrow.funded event
    NS->>M: Email + SMS: "Payment received. Ship now!"
    ES->>ES: Update status → MERCHANT_NOTIFIED
    ES->>MQ: Publish escrow.merchant.notified
    MQ->>NS: Deliver webhook to merchant's URL

    %% Step 4: Merchant Ships
    M->>AG: POST /escrow/{ref}/ship { trackingNumber }
    AG->>ES: Route (API key validated)
    ES->>ES: Validate transition MERCHANT_NOTIFIED → SHIPPED
    ES->>ES: Save tracking number, update status
    ES->>MQ: Publish escrow.shipped
    MQ->>NS: escrow.shipped event
    NS->>C: Email: "Your product is on its way! Tracking: GIG-XXXX"

    %% Step 5: Mark Delivered
    M->>AG: POST /escrow/{ref}/deliver
    AG->>ES: Route request
    ES->>ES: Update status → DELIVERED
    ES->>ES: Set confirmation_deadline = now + 72hrs
    ES->>MQ: Publish escrow.delivered
    MQ->>NS: escrow.delivered event
    NS->>C: Email + SMS: "Confirm receipt within 72 hours"

    %% Step 6: Customer Confirms
    C->>AG: POST /escrow/{ref}/confirm
    AG->>ES: Route (JWT validated)
    ES->>ES: Validate within confirmation window
    ES->>ES: Update status → CONFIRMED
    ES->>MQ: Publish escrow.confirmed
    MQ->>PO: escrow.confirmed event

    %% Step 7: Payout to Merchant
    PO->>PO: Read merchant bank account (decrypt)
    PO->>INT: POST /transfer { amount, recipient }
    INT-->>PO: Transfer initiated
    PO->>PO: Save payout (status=SUCCESS)
    PO->>MQ: Publish payout.completed
    MQ->>NS: payout.completed event
    NS->>M: Email: "₦837,250 has been sent to your bank account"
    NS->>C: Email: "Transaction complete. Thank you!"

    Note over C,INT: ── END: Both parties satisfied ──
